{"title":"Blueslate","slug":"Blueslate","hero":{"file":"Bluestale_Ore.webp","width":204,"height":205},"pageid":744,"revid":14303,"timestamp":"2024-08-12T21:15:08Z","lastEditor":"Z3SC","categories":["Stone","Ores"],"infobox":{"type":"Stone","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Ferwater"},{"label":"Stone","value":"$10/stud"},{"label":"Refined","value":"$12/stud"},{"label":"Forged","value":"$16/stud"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.4.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"10/03/2023"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>Blueslate</b> is one of the 6 ore holding stone nodes that spawns on <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Ferwater/\">Ferwater Island</a>. They're found throughout the entire island except the Oke desert. These nodes spawn in a medium range of sizes. \n</p><p>Despite its name, the blueslate isn't blue, but instead takes on a lighter grey color. It uses the new slate material texture for its raw form. In both refined and forged versions of the stone, it maintains the same or similar color. \n</p>\n<h5 id=\"the-chart-below-displays-all-possible-ores-that-spawn-within-this-node\">The chart below displays all possible ores that spawn within this node.</h5>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Iron1\">Iron1</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Iron/\">Iron</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Gold1\">Gold1</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gold/\">Gold</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Pyrite\">Pyrite</span></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Pyrite/\">Pyrite</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Lithium Oaklands\">Lithium Oaklands</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lithium/\">Lithium</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Cobalt Oaklands\">Cobalt Oaklands</span></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Cobalt/\">Cobalt</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Zinc2\">Zinc2</span></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Zinc/\">Zinc</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Mythril 1\">Mythril 1</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Mythril/\">Mythril</a></td>\n<td>1/100 chance spawn\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Adurite\">Adurite</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Adurite/\">Adurite</a></td>\n<td>1/125 chance spawn\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Bluesteel Ore Node\">Bluesteel Ore Node</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Bluesteel/\">Bluesteel</a></td>\n<td>1/1,000 chance spawn\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>Adurite spawns more common on blueslate than other nodes, taking a 1/125 chance to spawn instead of the usual 1/175.</li></ul>"}
